data/decks/core-vocab.json is DERIVED from JMdict_e and KANJIDIC2, produced and
distributed by the Electronic Dictionary Research and Development Group (EDRDG),
Monash University, under the direction of Jim Breen.

    https://www.edrdg.org/jmdict/j_jmdict.html
    https://www.edrdg.org/wiki/index.php/KANJIDIC_Project
    Licence: https://www.edrdg.org/edrdg/licence.html

